# Blacklisted wallpapers. One key per line: Wallhaven id for cached online
# downloads, absolute path for local files. Managed automatically by
# wallpaper.sh (--blacklist) and the wallpaper-gui.py picker -- you normally
# don't need to edit this by hand.
#
# Copy this file to ~/.config/wallpaper/blacklist.txt to start with an empty
# blacklist.
